1. Name your Solution (10 words max)
A. GenTwin-Guard: AI-Driven Digital Twin for Proactive Industrial Cybersecurity

2. 2. Describe in Brief Your Solution (100 words max)
A. GenTwin integrates the SWaT industrial dataset with a Generative AI–powered Digital Twin to proactively uncover hidden cybersecurity gaps in industrial control systems.
The system models normal plant behavior using a digital twin and employs GenAI to generate realistic, unseen cyber-attack scenarios. These attacks are injected into the twin to observe system responses, detect anomalies, and identify vulnerabilities that traditional rule-based or supervised models often miss. 
The solution provides a safe, data-driven environment to test ICS resilience and improve security preparedness without risking real-world infrastructure.

3. USP of the Solution (100 words max)
A. The unique strength of GenTwin lies in combining Generative AI with a live Digital Twin of an industrial system. Unlike conventional intrusion detection systems that rely on known attack signatures, 
GenTwin continuously generates novel attack patterns and tests them in a simulated environment. This allows organizations to discover previously unknown vulnerabilities, logic flaws, and blind spots. 
The approach is proactive, scalable, and safe, making it especially suitable for critical infrastructure where real-world testing is risky or impossible.


